ingredients. This philosophy weaves through our products, our projects, and our partnerships.</p><p>We strive to live the same way we formulate—grounded in integrity, simplicity, and purity.</p><p>We believe in the ritual of daily bathing and in a deeper kind of beauty—one that goes far beyond skincare.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p><strong>Program Outline + Perks</strong></p><ul><li><p>60-day cookie window</p></li><li><p>Unlimited discount codes </p></li><li><p>Tiered commission structure ranging from 5%–15%</p></li><li><p>Monthly posting requirements to maintain active status</p></li><li><p>Minimum sales threshold to remain an active affiliate</p></li><li><p>Exclusive quarterly discounts for affiliates</p></li><li><p>Early access to new product launches and sales</p></li><li><p>Dedicated one-on-one support from our team to help you succeed</p></li></ul><p><strong>Who You Are</strong><br>You value simplicity and intentionally support your health and well-being by choosing real, natural, and non-toxic alternatives to conventional beauty products.</p><p>Your commitment to a healthier, more conscious lifestyle inspires those around you. You cultivate authentic, meaningful connections within your community and create a positive, lasting impact in the lives of others.</p></div></div>",
